            <title>[IGNITE-4800] Lucene query may fails with NPE.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4800</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;GridLuceneFile &apos;buffers&apos; field is set to null regardless file can be used in GridLuceneInputStream by some query.&lt;br/&gt;
